{title: Lead Me to Calvary}
{artist: Jennie Hussey & William Kirkpatrick}
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 76}

Verse 1
[C]King of my life, I [F]crown thee [C]now — [D]thine shall the glory [G]be;
[C]lest I forget thy [F]thorn-crowned [C]brow, [G]lead me to Calva[C]ry.

Chorus
Lest I for[F]get Gethsema[C]ne, lest I for[G]get thine agony,
lest [C]I forget thy [F]love for [C]me, [G]lead me to Calva[C]ry.
